ABS      EQU   1:5
         ORIG  3000
B1       ENT1  0         B1. Find power of 2.
         LDX   U         rX ← u.
         LDAN  V         rA ← −v.
         JMP   1F
2H       SRB   1         Halve rA, rX.
         INC1  1         k ← k + 1.
         STX   U         u ← u/2.
         STA   V(ABS)    v ← v/2.
1H       JXO   B4        To B4 with t ← −v if u is odd.
B2       JAE   2B        B2. Initialize.
         LDA   U         t ← u.
B3       SRB   1         B3. Halve t.
B4       JAE   B3        B4. Is t even?
B5       JAN   1F        B5. Reset max(u, v).
         STA   U         If t > 0, set u ← t.
         SUB   V         t ← u − v.
         JMP   2F
1H       STA   V(ABS)    If t < 0, set v ← −t.
B6       ADD   U         B6. Subtract.
2H       JANZ  B3        To B3 if t ≠ 0.
         LDA   U         rA ← u.
         ENTX  0         rX ← 0.
         SLB   0,1       rA ← 2^k · rA.
         HLT
U        CON   40902
V        CON   24140
         END   B1
